00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:35.610
The sea is in blue slumber.

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:35.610
Umi wa aoku nemuri

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:38.200
Life is blooming on the land.

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:38.200
Daichi ni inochi mebae

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:41.330
And the sky, and the sky

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:41.330
