00:01:57.010 --> 00:02:02.890
Swim, make waves! Run, kick up the soil!

00:01:57.010 --> 00:02:02.890
Oyoge nami ketate hashire tsuchi o keri

00:02:03.510 --> 00:02:08.730
Because you love the Earth so much.

